- 在二维码页面添加【开始投票】按钮
- 输入管理员密码后启动3分钟倒计时
- 倒计时实时显示在二维码下方
- 倒计时结束自动跳转到结果页
- 支持投屏展示整个流程

使用流程：
1. 投屏二维码页面 /qr
2. 点击【开始投票】输入密码
3. 3分钟倒计时自动开始
4. 用户扫码投票
5. 倒计时结束自动跳转到结果页

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 views/qr.html | 206 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 203 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/views/qr.html b/views/qr.html
index 4c18d31..8f25dfb 100644
--- a/views/qr.html
+++ b/views/qr.html
@@ -16,34 +16,140 @@
     }
     .qr-container {
       background: white;
-      padding: 40px;
+      padding: 50px;
       border-radius: 16px;
       box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
       text-align: center;
+      max-width: 500px;
     }
     h1 {
-      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
+      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
       color: #333;
+      font-size: 32px;
+    }
+    .subtitle {
+      color: #666;
+      margin-bottom: 30px;
+      font-size: 18px;
     }
     #qrcode {
       margin: 20px 0;
     }
+    #qrcode img {
+      border: 3px solid #1890ff;
+      border-radius: 8px;
+      padding: 10px;
+    }
     .url {
       color: #666;
       font-size: 14px;
       word-break: break-all;
+      margin-top: 20px;
+    }
+    .countdown-section {
+      display: none;
+      margin-top: 30px;
+      padding-top: 30px;
+      border-top: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
+    }
+    .countdown-section.active {
+      display: block;
+    }
+    .countdown-timer {
+      font-size: 72px;
+      font-weight: 700;
+      color: #1890ff;
+      margin: 20px 0;
+      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
+    }
+    .countdown-timer.warning {
+      color: #ff4d4f;
+      animation: pulse 1s infinite;
+    }
+    @keyframes pulse {
+      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
+      50% { opacity: 0.6; }
+    }
+    .countdown-label {
